# Generated Rust / Nix local artifacts.
# Per the verifier's instruction: keep only what would otherwise leak
# build state into the worktree. Every entry here is a reproducible
# artifact (regenerated by `cargo build`, `nix flake update`, or
# `direnv allow`).
target/

# Cargo.lock is intentionally NOT ignored: the plan requires a
# committed lockfile (`cargo sync` mode for the deterministic
# fixture/report slice).

# direnv cache (per-developer, reproducible).
.direnv/

# Agent orchestration state (plans, evidence, run continuation).
.omo/

# Local nix store references (per-developer, reproducible).
result*
